  <item>
    <coll>Gtn</coll>
    <ref>Gtn031.001</ref>
    <rnb>369</rnb>
    <tib>de bzhin gshegs pa zhi ba thams cad 'dus pa rtsa ba'i rgyud zhes bya ba</tib>
    <skt>sarba ta thA ga ta shan ti mahA san tu ya na tan tra na ma</skt>
    <coloph>bcoMdas kyis de skad ces bka' stsal nas/ nyid kyi sku gsung thugs yum dang bcas pa'i/ byin gyis brlabs kyis rnaMr 'phrul pa'i dkyil 'khor chen po'i/ 'khor lo yongsu rdzogs pa de dag dang/ dus gsum du bzhugs pa'i sangs rgyas thaMd kyi lag na rdo rje 'chang pa mthu bo chen po dang bcas pa rnams rab tu / dgyes yid rangs pas 'od zer gyi rnam pa dpag tu med par gyur nas/ yang khams gsum pa'i dngos po ma lus par sbyangs nas/ bcoMdas kyi sku la thim par gyur to/ bcoMdas kun bzang po nyid ni yum dang/ gnyisu med par slar yang/ chos nyid zhi ba'i klong rnam par dag pa'i dbyings de nyid du gnas te bzhugs nas/ phyi ma'i 'gro ba'i don bsam gyis mi khyab dag la rang bzhin gyis dgongs nas mi mda' ba nyid du mdzado/ zhi ba 'dus pa rtsa ba'i rgyud / rdoe dbyings kyi dkyior chen po'i dgongs pa rdzogso / /rgya gar gyi mkhan po slob dpon chen po pad+ma 'byung gnas dang/ bod kyi lo tsa ba bai' ro tsa nas bsgyur zhing bris te gtan la phab pa'o/ rgyal po bla dpe'o</coloph>
